A small wave catches the evening light, glowing translucent.
</p>

<p class="jp">
<span class="title_jp">緑の葉巻</span>
日の光を受けて、小さな波が透き通るように輝いている。


</p>]]></content><author><name>Daniel Sofer</name></author><category term="Hermosa Beach" /><category term="Golden Hour" /><category term="Surf" /><category term="Water" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[A small wave catches the evening light, glowing translucent.]]></summary><media:thumbnail xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://hermosawavephotography.com/assets/images/2026/2609_A7R06937.jpg" /><media:content medium="image" url="https://hermosawavephotography.com/assets/images/2026/2609_A7R06937.jpg" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" /></entry><entry><title type="html">26th Street</title><link href="https://hermosawavephotography.com/260921/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="26th Street" /><published>2026-09-21T00:00:00-07:00</published><updated>2026-09-21T00:00:00-07:00</updated><id>https://hermosawavephotography.com/26th-st</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://hermosawavephotography.com/260921/"><![CDATA[<p class="en">
Sunset in Hermosa Beach, at  the 26th St. Volleyball Court.
</p>

<p class="jp">
<span class="title_jp"></span>
ハーモサビーチの26丁目バレーボールコートでの夕日。


</p>]]></content><author><name>Daniel Sofer</name></author><category term="Hermosa Beach" /><category term="Sunset" /><category term="Volleyball" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[Sunset in Hermosa Beach, at the 26th St. Volleyball Court.]]></summary><media:thumbnail xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://hermosawavephotography.com/assets/images/2026/2609_A7R07002.jpg" /><media:content medium="image" url="https://hermosawavephotography.com/assets/images/2026/2609_A7R07002.jpg" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" /></entry><entry><title type="html">Blue Water</title><link href="https://hermosawavephotography.com/260916/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Blue Water" /><published>2026-09-16T00:00:00-07:00</published><updated>2026-09-16T00:00:00-07:00</updated><id>https://hermosawavephotography.com/blue-water</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://hermosawavephotography.com/260916/"><![CDATA[<p class="en">
Looking at northern Manhattan Beach from the pier.
</p>

<p class="jp">
<span class="title_jp">碧水</span>
桟橋からマンハッタンビーチの北側を眺めている。

</p>]]></content><author><name>Daniel Sofer</name></author><category term="Manhattan Beach" /><category term="Water" /><category term="Beach" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[Looking at northern Manhattan Beach from the pier.]]></summary><media:thumbnail xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://hermosawavephotography.com/assets/images/2026/2609_A7R06492.jpg" /><media:content medium="image" url="https://hermosawavephotography.com/assets/images/2026/2609_A7R06492.jpg" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" /></entry><entry><title type="html">Strand Flora</title><link href="https://hermosawavephotography.com/260915/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Strand Flora" /><published>2026-09-15T00:00:00-07:00</published><updated>2026-09-15T00:00:00-07:00</updated><id>https://hermosawavephotography.com/flora</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://hermosawavephotography.com/260915/"><![CDATA[<p class="en">
Plumeria in bloom along the Strand in Manhattan Beach.
</p>

<p class="jp">
<span class="title_jp">ストランドの植物</span>
マンハッタンビーチのストランド沿いで咲くプルメリア。

</p>]]></content><author><name>Daniel Sofer</name></author><category term="Manhattan Beach" /><category term="Flowers" /><category term="Beach" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[Plumeria in bloom along the Strand in Manhattan Beach.]]></summary><media:thumbnail xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://hermosawavephotography.com/assets/images/2026/2609_A7R06475.jpg" /><media:content medium="image" url="https://hermosawavephotography.com/assets/images/2026/2609_A7R06475.jpg" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" /></entry><entry><title type="html">1964 NY World’s Fair</title><link href="https://hermosawavephotography.com/260914/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="1964 NY World’s Fair" /><published>2026-09-14T00:00:00-07:00</published><updated>2026-09-14T00:00:00-07:00</updated><id>https://hermosawavephotography.com/worlds-fair</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://hermosawavephotography.com/260914/"><![CDATA[<p class="en">
The past few weeks I've been scanning my parents’ Kodachrome slides, and have unearthed many wonderful photos of me and my family. This one is of me - age 12 - in front of the Unisphere at the 1964-65 New York World’s Fair.
</p>
    <p class="en">
It was a different world 60 years ago. The 1964 World's Fair was bristling with optimism about technology and the future. <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/I.G.Y._(What_a_Beautiful_World)" target="_blank">Donald Fagen wrote a song</a> about the promise of those times.
</p>
<p class="en">
<a href="https://blog.hermosawavephotography.com/preserving-a-trove-of-visual-history/" target="_blank">More about this photo and the slide scanning project on my blog.</a>
</p>


<p class="jp">
<span class="title_jp">1964年ニューヨーク万国博覧会</span>

ここ数週間、両親のコダクロームのスライドをスキャンしていて、私や家族が写った素晴らしい写真をたくさん見つけた。これは、1964年から65年にかけて開催されたニューヨーク万国博覧会のユニスフィアの前で、12歳の私が写っている写真だ。
</p>
<p class="jp">
    60年前の世界は今とはまったく違っていた。1964年の万国博覧会は、技術と未来への楽観に満ち溢れていた。ドナルド・フェイゲンは、<a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/I.G.Y._(What_a_Beautiful_World)" target="_blank">その時代の希望を歌った曲を書いた</a>。
この写真やスライドスキャンプロジェクトの詳細は、<a href="https://blog.hermosawavephotography.com/preserving-a-trove-of-visual-history/" target="_blank">私のブログで紹介している</a>。




</p>]]></content><author><name>Daniel Sofer</name></author><category term="New York" /><category term="Film" /><category term="Architecture" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[The past few weeks I've been scanning my parents’ Kodachrome slides, and have unearthed many wonderful photos of me and my family. This one is of me - age 12 - in front of the Unisphere at the 1964-65 New York World’s Fair. It was a different world 60 years ago. The 1964 World's Fair was bristling with optimism about technology and the future. Donald Fagen wrote a song about the promise of those times. More about this photo and the slide scanning project on my blog.]]></summary><media:thumbnail xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://hermosawavephotography.com/assets/images/2026/2609_A7R06227.jpg" /><media:content medium="image" url="https://hermosawavephotography.com/assets/images/2026/2609_A7R06227.jpg" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" /></entry><entry><title type="html">Sunset Ride</title><link href="https://hermosawavephotography.com/260911/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Sunset Ride" /><published>2026-09-11T00:00:00-07:00</published><updated>2026-09-11T00:00:00-07:00</updated><id>https://hermosawavephotography.com/sunset-ridef</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://hermosawavephotography.com/260911/"><![CDATA[<p class="en">
Surfers in the lineup south of the Manhattan Beach Pier.
</p>

<p class="jp">
<span class="title_jp">サンセット・ライド</span>

マンハッタン・ビーチ・ピアの南側、ラインアップにいるサーファーたち。

</p>]]></content><author><name>Daniel Sofer</name></author><category term="Manhattan Beach" /><category term="Surf" /><category term="Sunset" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[Surfers in the lineup south of the Manhattan Beach Pier.]]></summary><media:thumbnail xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://hermosawavephotography.com/assets/images/2026/2609_A7R05999.jpg" /><media:content medium="image" url="https://hermosawavephotography.com/assets/images/2026/2609_A7R05999.jpg" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" /></entry><entry><title type="html">Sun &amp;amp; Surf</title><link href="https://hermosawavephotography.com/260910/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Sun &amp;amp; Surf" /><published>2026-09-10T00:00:00-07:00</published><updated>2026-09-10T00:00:00-07:00</updated><id>https://hermosawavephotography.com/sun-and-surf</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://hermosawavephotography.com/260910/"><![CDATA[<p class="en">
A wave rolls into the shore at sunset. Surfers wait for one more ride.</p>

<p class="jp">
<span class="title_jp">太陽と波</span>
夕暮れ時、波が岸へと押し寄せる。サーファーたちは、あとひと波を待っている。

</p>]]></content><author><name>Daniel Sofer</name></author><category term="Manhattan Beach" /><category term="Surf" /><category term="Sunset" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[A wave rolls into the shore at sunset. Surfers wait for one more ride.]]></summary><media:thumbnail xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://hermosawavephotography.com/assets/images/2026/2609_A7R06112.jpg" /><media:content medium="image" url="https://hermosawavephotography.com/assets/images/2026/2609_A7R06112.jpg" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" /></entry><entry><title type="html">Fishing With Sunset</title><link href="https://hermosawavephotography.com/260909/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Fishing With Sunset" /><published>2026-09-09T00:00:00-07:00</published><updated>2026-09-09T00:00:00-07:00</updated><id>https://hermosawavephotography.com/fishing</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://hermosawavephotography.com/260909/"><![CDATA[<p class="en">
Fisherman with his lines out, watching the sunset at the Redondo Beach Pier.</p>

<p class="jp">
<span class="title_jp">夕暮れの釣り</span>
レドンド・ビーチ・ピアで夕日が沈む中、釣り人が釣り糸を垂らしている。

</p>]]></content><author><name>Daniel Sofer</name></author><category term="Redondo Beach" /><category term="Piers" /><category term="Sunset" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[Fisherman with his lines out, watching the sunset at the Redondo Beach Pier.]]></summary><media:thumbnail xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://hermosawavephotography.com/assets/images/2026/2609_A7R05752.jpg" /><media:content medium="image" url="https://hermosawavephotography.com/assets/images/2026/2609_A7R05752.jpg" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" /></entry><entry><title type="html">Sand Stripes</title><link href="https://hermosawavephotography.com/260908/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Sand Stripes" /><published>2026-09-08T00:00:00-07:00</published><updated>2026-09-08T00:00:00-07:00</updated><id>https://hermosawavephotography.com/sand-stripes</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://hermosawavephotography.com/260908/"><![CDATA[<p class="en">
Sun shines through the Hermosa Beach Pier, creating stripes on the sand.
</p>

<p class="jp">
<span class="title_jp">砂の縞模様</span>
ハモサ・ビーチの桟橋の隙間から差し込む夕日の光が、砂の上に縞模様を映し出している。
</p>]]></content><author><name>Daniel Sofer</name></author><category term="Hermosa Beach" /><category term="Beach" /><category term="Hermosa Pier" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[Sun shines through the Hermosa Beach Pier, creating stripes on the sand.]]></summary><media:thumbnail xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://hermosawavephotography.com/assets/images/2026/2609_A7R05928.jpg" /><media:content medium="image" url="https://hermosawavephotography.com/assets/images/2026/2609_A7R05928.jpg" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" /></entry><entry><title type="html">Red Dragon</title><link href="https://hermosawavephotography.com/260907/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Red Dragon" /><published>2026-09-07T00:00:00-07:00</published><updated>2026-09-07T00:00:00-07:00</updated><id>https://hermosawavephotography.com/red-dragon</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://hermosawavephotography.com/260907/"><![CDATA[<p class="en">
A rare summer shower. It was still raining when I arrived at the Redondo Beach Pier to take this photo.  Unusual conditions sometimes yield spectacular shows in the sky.
</p>

<p class="jp">
<span class="title_jp">赤龍</span>
珍しい夏のにわか雨だ。この写真を撮るためにレドンド・ビーチ・ピアに到着した時も、まだ雨が降っていた。こうした珍しい気象条件が、時に空に壮観な光景を生み出すことがある。
</p>]]></content><author><name>Daniel Sofer</name></author><category term="Redondo Beach" /><category term="Dusk" /><category term="Clouds" /><category term="Panoramas" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[A rare summer shower. It was still raining when I arrived at the Redondo Beach Pier to take this photo. Unusual conditions sometimes yield spectacular shows in the sky.]]></summary><media:thumbnail xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://hermosawavephotography.com/assets/images/2026/2609_A7R05782-Pano.jpg" /><media:content medium="image" url="https://hermosawavephotography.com/assets/images/2026/2609_A7R05782-Pano.jpg" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" /></entry></feed>